00:13:50.126 --> 00:13:52.691
- Let's focus on what
benefits are inherent

00:13:52.691 --> 00:13:54.256
in any situation.

00:13:54.256 --> 00:13:57.565
And let's not focus on what
we've been deprived of.

00:13:57.565 --> 00:13:59.249
Because we can't,

00:13:59.249 --> 00:14:01.503
we control only that attitude, right?

00:14:01.503 --> 00:14:02.925
And so we might as well give ourselves

00:14:02.925 --> 00:14:05.089
the attitude that pushes us forward,

00:14:05.089 --> 00:14:06.582
that makes us feel,

00:14:06.582 --> 00:14:09.544
that seizes on what we
are empowered to do,

00:14:09.544 --> 00:14:13.062
and not dwell on what
we've been deprived of,

00:14:13.062 --> 00:14:15.279
or what is holding us back.

00:14:15.279 --> 00:14:17.769
I do think it's interesting
how we sort of expect,

00:14:17.769 --> 00:14:20.291
like, a few months ago, I got injured,

00:14:20.291 --> 00:14:23.209
and I couldn't work out for
like about a week or so.

00:14:23.209 --> 00:14:27.209
And it was like, why did
I think that I could go

00:14:28.268 --> 00:14:29.719
my whole life without being,

00:14:29.719 --> 00:14:32.204
like why did I think I would
never be injured, right?

00:14:32.204 --> 00:14:35.522
Why did I think it would,
I would all, it would,

00:14:35.522 --> 00:14:36.711
every time I would roll my ankle,

00:14:36.711 --> 00:14:37.987
it would turn out to be nothing.

00:14:37.987 --> 00:14:38.886
Do you know what I mean?

00:14:38.886 --> 00:14:40.737
Sometimes it turns out to be something.

00:14:40.737 --> 00:14:42.404
And the more we can,

00:14:44.338 --> 00:14:48.070
the more we can tell
ourselves that these are

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.933
realities of life, the
less devastated we'll be

00:14:50.933 --> 00:14:53.588
when they happen, and the
more quickly we can bounce

00:14:53.588 --> 00:14:55.576
back from them, do you know what I mean?

00:14:55.576 --> 00:14:58.826
Like if someone does something rude or,

00:14:59.952 --> 00:15:01.614
you know, screwed up to you,

00:15:01.614 --> 00:15:03.787
and you're like why did this happen?

00:15:03.787 --> 00:15:06.251
This is so unfair, how
could they do this to me?

00:15:06.251 --> 00:15:08.856
And all you're doing is
wallowing in self-pity,

00:15:08.856 --> 00:15:12.012
you know, that's precious
energy that you're not spending

00:15:12.012 --> 00:15:15.491
towards your, you know, your reply,

00:15:15.491 --> 00:15:19.622
towards your response, or what
you're going to do instead.

